@startuml
actor User
participant Extension
participant Backend
participant EmbedAPI
participant VectorDB
participant LLM

User -> Extension : enter query
Extension -> Backend : POST /search {q, auth}
Backend -> EmbedAPI : request embedding for {q}
EmbedAPI --> Backend : return embedding vector
Backend -> VectorDB : vector search (k-NN)
VectorDB --> Backend : candidate ids + scores
Backend -> LLM : build prompt + request completion
LLM --> Backend : answer (text)
Backend --> Extension : JSON {results, answer}
Extension --> User : render results
@enduml
